In addition, Legion encounters in [[Mirage]]s have a chance to spawn an [[Afarud]] Legion instead of the normal five. They drop Maraketh splinters/emblems, and their general is [[Forgotten Afarud Commander]]. {{il|Honoured Incubator}}, {{il|Sacred Incubator}}, and {{il|Miraged Incubator}} were historically exclusively acquired from Afarud Legion monsters and chests.

